# Per-run CCF output (regenerable). The benchmark result of record,
# CCF_Sovereign/data/benchmarks/continual_learning_latest.json, IS tracked —
# it carries the Merkle root, so the claim survives without the raw ledgers.
CCF_Sovereign/data/benchmarks/run_*/
CCF_Sovereign/data/operator_bootcheck/
CCF_Sovereign/evaluation/bridgedata_rollouts/
CCF_Sovereign/evaluation/bridgedata_cross_rollouts/
